{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18597","headline":"南省转牒欲具江国图令尽通风俗故事 · 柳宗元","name":"南省转牒欲具江国图令尽通风俗故事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"圣代提封尽海壖，狼荒犹得纪山川。\n华夷图上应初录，风土记中殊未传。\n椎髻老人难借问，黄茆深峒敢留连。\n南宫有意求遗俗，试检周书王会篇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"柳宗元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18597.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18597","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}